31012324,70,'do not use',2473,20,tumor2,RoncDoc,import,'12-01-2018 14:01:04','13-12-2018 13:49:14','12-01-2018 00:00:00','14-08-2038 23:59:59',nl,,mah6-4ega,0,0,2,433704051C019O,1999-11-30,1999-11-30,1999-11-30,2014-12-22,,,2,,,,A1,,A3,0,,,8070,,,,C019,,,,,,,4A,0,0,,,,,,,,,1,,3,,4,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,,2,,,,5,,-oth-,,,,1999-11-30,2015-01-07,,,-oth-,hyperthermie,-oth-,,,,1999-11-30,2015-01-07,,,,,-oth-,,,,,,,,,-oth-,,,,,,,,-oth-,,,,,2015-01-23,,,,,'RTx met hyperthermie  patiënt werd bestraald met 6 fracties van 5.5 Gy (2x per week) op de tumor in de tongbasis middels het cyberknife. Deze behandeling werd gecombineerd met diepe hyperthermie middels de HyperCollar, 1x per week.',,,2,0,0,0,0,A1,14,0,0,,1,,A3,A1,A1,A1,A2,A1,A1,A1,A1,A3,A1,A1,A3,172,111.8,0,1,6,,2007,1,2,0,1,,2,2,'2011 recidief PE bdz.  DMII metformine  Hb 8.0  111,8 kg 172 stabiel gewicht.  Roken –   Alcohol 14 per week.  Goede conditie (?)',,
